{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/0a82d48d151413110b908e9801d8e4eb.avif?t=1769633195\" width=609 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrown onto a hostile arena and surrounded by hundreds of monsters, you\u2019ve got one job \u2013 don\u2019t die in the first five seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You\u2019re not a legendary hero \u2013 you\u2019re the failed result of a military experiment. Luckily, you\u2019ve got something far better than an epic backstory: an absurd arsenal and a free hand to unleash chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Head</strong> is a <strong>bullet heaven roguelite</strong> where the screen quickly transforms into a colorful kaleidoscope of bullets, explosions, and increasingly bizarre weapons. Every run is an experiment:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1769633195\" width=609 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/0c5a830ca9a89b5f06d90ef2f05c85c9.avif?t=1769633195\" alt=\"Non-linear progression\" width=609 height=78 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/82594516a974e7c34a131d6a6b709f13.poster.avif?t=1769633195\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/82594516a974e7c34a131d6a6b709f13.webm?t=1769633195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/82594516a974e7c34a131d6a6b709f13.mp4?t=1769633195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 unique weapons \u2013 each with its own upgrade tree featuring 10\u201315 skills to unlock. This isn\u2019t just about pumping stats \u2013 it\u2019s about shaping your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a simple slingshot into a weapon of mass destruction, or build a setup that drags enemies into a spiral of chaos. Weapons can be mixed, upgraded, and experimented with to discover surprising synergies that can clear the screen in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/0fdfce83c0660aa3612d17ee2d815fbd.avif?t=1769633195\" alt=\"Runes &amp;amp; Modifiers\" width=609 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want the game to play itself? Turn on auto-fire and focus on dodging. Craving risk? Increase enemy density for bigger rewards. Want to force special events? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runes let you bend the core rules of the game \u2013 ensuring each run feels fresh and different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/c798bcf8abb9d146929a36a6dc8a12e7.avif?t=1769633195\" alt=\"Absurd arsenal\" width=609 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boredom doesn\u2019t exist here. A slingshot, a flip-flop, an acid tank, chaos orbs, or even a bow of love \u2013 the weirder the weapon, the sweeter the satisfaction when you crush an army of monsters with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own identity and growth path, and once you start combining them\u2026 that\u2019s pure destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/2077b6eb1af7cab60e6284d22a589fa6.avif?t=1769633195\" alt=\"Fast, intense sessions\" width=609 height=78 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t need to commit an entire evening \u2013 one run lasts 10\u201330 minutes, but the tension never lets up for a second. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure action, as the screen turns into a kaleidoscope of bullets, effects, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/272e694db620d3dc7016984eae132ecb.avif?t=1769633195\" alt=\"High replayability\" width=609 height=78 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt tells a new story. Random events, diverse runes, and dozens of build options ensure no two runs are alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character isn\u2019t just a hero \u2013 it\u2019s a visual-musical avatar of madness that evolves and mutates alongside your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/bfcf94f5d6196d7fd7126d6a19725c22.avif?t=1769633195\" alt=\"Bosses &amp;amp; enemy waves\" width=609 height=78 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/2a29318e4e36c1a994f8bd97a368e1c2.poster.avif?t=1769633195\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/2a29318e4e36c1a994f8bd97a368e1c2.webm?t=1769633195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/2a29318e4e36c1a994f8bd97a368e1c2.mp4?t=1769633195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, it\u2019s just small critters you smash to pieces. But every passing minute makes things worse: bigger swarms, nastier enemies, and bosses that demand creativity \u2013 and sometimes desperation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake costs your life, and every victory tastes twice as sweet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1769633195\" width=609 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Head</strong> is a game where chaos becomes an art of destruction, and every weapon and every rune opens up new ways to spread mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1769633195\" width=609 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Blast Head</strong> to your <u><strong>Steam wishlist</strong></u> and get ready for a ballet of total absurdity.</p>","background"