center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1769633195\" width=609 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Head</strong> is a game where chaos becomes an art of destruction, and every weapon and every rune opens up new ways to spread mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/extras/66fa103eb0c35885a3253f07b1dd0134.webp?t=1769633195\" width=609 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Blast Head</strong> to your <u><strong>Steam wishlist</strong></u> and get ready for a ballet of total absurdity.</p>","developers":["Basement Rift"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054260/bec36aea4560b30c9e1cbd4d5fe522e3e0e66443/header.jpg?t=1769633195","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2054260/170538425/263edf1288506319f3e0a951a6be94171b8aae3e/1758366557/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758368797","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2054260/170538425/263edf1288506319f3e0a951a6be94171b8aae3e/1758366557/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758368797","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2054260/170538425/263edf1288506319f3e0a951a6be94171b8aae3e/1758366557/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758368797","id":257202695,"name":"Blast Head - Trailer - HD","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202695/fb966976845826018394fcb3c08a573f5e154707/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758368797"}],"name":"Blast Head","pac